s that are powered by generative AI.","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/mp-solutions-aim/ada-logo-162x40.e8b06a79fee7a4f75704c648defa92a47a6d24b3.png","displayLocation":"Americas","customerNameLower":"ada support","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Software \u0026 Internet","sortDate":"2025-01-16","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/ada-support-eks-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Ada Support","publishedDate":"2025","enableShare":"1","headline":"Achieving Near-Zero Downtime and Powering Generative AI Using Amazon EKS with Ada","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#eks","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Elastic Kubernetes Service (EKS)","description":"Amazon Elastic Kubernetes Service (EKS)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:58+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:32+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#containers","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Containers","description":"Containers","dateCreated":"2020-02-13T00:27:17+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:26+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#cost-mgmt","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Cloud Financial Management","description":"Cloud Financial Management","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:13+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:27+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#ec2","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon EC2","description":"Amazon EC2","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:51+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:31+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#managed","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Man